{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22225","headline":"烹葵 · 白居易","name":"烹葵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨卧不夕食，今起乃朝饥。\n贫厨何所有，炊稻烹秋葵。\n红粒香复輭，绿英滑且肥。\n饥来止於饱，饱後复何思。\n忆昔荣遇日，迨今穷退时。\n今亦不冻馁，昔亦无余资。\n口既不减食，身又不减衣。\n抚心私自问，何者是荣衰。\n勿学常人意，其间分是非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22225.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22225","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}